{"strongs": "H0476", "word": "אֱלִישָׁמָע", "translit": "e.li.sha.ma", "root": "אלה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "a.", "gloss": "a priest", "definition": "אֱלִישָׁמָע ( God has heard , compare יִשְׁמָעֵאל , & Sabean אלסמע , יסמעאל Hal 187, 193 ) \\ \\ a. chief of Ephraim Num 1:10 ; Num 2:18 ; Num 7:48 ; Num 7:53 ; Num 10:22 ; 1Chr 7:26 . \\ \\ b. son of David 2Sam 5:16 ; 1Chr 3:6 ; 1Chr 3:8 ; 1Chr 14:7 . \\ \\ c. scribe of Jehoiakim Jer 36:12 ; Jer 36:20 ; Jer 36:21 . \\ \\ d. one of the royal seed 2Kgs 25:25 ; Jer 41:1 . \\ \\ e. a man of Judah 1Chr 2:41 . feminine a priest 2Chr 17:8 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB458')\">BDB458</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H476')\">H476</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB457')\">BDB457</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB459')\">BDB459</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֱלִישָׁמָע</bdbheb> (<highlight>God has heard</highlight>, compare <bdbheb>יִשְׁמָעֵאל</bdbheb>, &amp; Sabean <bdbheb>אלסמע</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יסמעאל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>187, 193</sup></lookup>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> chief of Ephraim <ref ref=\"Num 1:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,10)\">Num 1:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,18)\">Num 2:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 7:48\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(4,7,48)\">Num 7:48</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 7:53\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"53\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"53\" onclick=\"bcv(4,7,53)\">Num 7:53</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,22)\">Num 10:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:26\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,26)\">1Chr 7:26</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> son of David <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"5\" vEn